  "readme": "[![DOI](https://img.shields.io/badge/DOI-10.82901%2Fnemar.on005127-blue)](https://doi.org/10.82901/nemar.on005127)\nThis dataset contains data from an overnight EEG-fMRI study, performed in the\nAdvanced MRI section, LFMI, NINDS, National Institutes of Health, in\napproximately 2016-2017. This study is called 'sleep1', and is the pilot study\nfor 'sleep2', which ran from 2019-2024 (doi:10.18112/openneuro.ds006163.v1.0.0,\ntentatively publicly released in September 2028). Subjects were scanned for two\nconsecutive nights for approximately 8 hours using EEG/fMRI, and were aroused\nat random intervals 8 times during the night.",
